<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes credit auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes credit auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Banco de Mexico completed all three of its credit auctions on the secondary market on Wednesday.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     AVERAGE MAXIMUM MINIMUM BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.552 bln pesos  12 days  25.97   26.00   25.90    8	3</p>
<p>1.553 bln pesos   6 days  25.31   25.32   25.13    2	2</p>
<p>1.000 bln pesos   1 day   24.75   24.90   24.70    7	3</p>
<p>The minimum, maximum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9559</p>
</text>
